%U A400882 5607630602158,34636704299035,215269557208478,1345531555533771,8454227740602060
%N A400882 Number of sum-indecomposable s-meandric permutations of length n.
%C A400882 A permutation pi is sum-indecomposable if no k with 1<=k<n satisfies {pi(1),...,pi(k)}={1,...,k}. The sequence counts those permutations that are realizable by singular open meanders.
%H A400882 Yury Belousov, <a href="https://github.com/YuryBelousov/s_meandric">C++ code for generating the sequence</a>, GitHub.
%H A400882 Yury Belousov and Viktoriia Georgievskaia, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.30068">S-meandric Permutations and Tangency Polynomials</a>, arXiv:2609.30068 [math.CO], 2026.
%F A400882 a(n) = A400881(n) - Sum_{k=1..n-1} a(k)*A400881(n-k).
%e A400882 For n=3, the permutations are 231, 312, and 321; a(3)=3.
%Y A400882 Cf. A400881, A393122.
%K A400882 nonn,new
%O A400882 1,3
